---
const highlights = ['具体场景', '可验收模块', '人工确认'];
---

<section id="home" class="snap-section relative isolate min-h-[100svh] overflow-hidden bg-canvas px-5 pt-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-[-12rem] -z-10 h-[34rem] w-[56rem] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand-500/[0.10] blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute right-[-14rem] top-44 -z-10 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full bg-brand-500/[0.08] blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="section-inner grid min-h-[calc(100svh-6rem)] items-start gap-12 py-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.98fr_1.02fr] lg:pt-16">
    <div class="fade-in select-none">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-5">AI 功能模块开发与业务自动化协作</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-[46rem] text-[2.42rem] font-medium leading-[1.06] tracking-normal text-ink sm:text-[3.72rem] lg:text-[4.35rem]">
        <span class="block">把明确的业务问题，</span>
        <span class="blue-gradient-text block font-medium">做成可交付的 AI 功能模块</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-[42rem] text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-muted sm:text-lg">
        面向软件公司、企业服务商、代运营团队和中小企业，围绕客服、外贸、电商、表格、工单和知识库等具体场景，交付可集成、可验收、可迭代的 AI 工具与半自动化流程。
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[38rem] text-base leading-8 text-muted">
        不从泛泛的“AI 转型”开始，而是先选择一个真实、重复、可验证的小场景，完成小模块交付后再迭代扩展。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a class="pill-button pill-primary" href="#contact">
          描述你的业务问题
        </a>
        <a class="pill-button pill-secondary" href="#examples">
          查看常见场景
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {highlights.map((item) => (
          <span class="rounded-full border border-black/10 bg-white/[0.56] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-muted shadow-sm backdrop-blur-xl">{item}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fade-in relative lg:pt-6">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-10 top-6 h-40 rounded-full bg-brand-500/[0.12] blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="surface-card subtle-glow relative overflow-hidden p-4 sm:p-5">
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/70 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] border border-black/10 bg-white/[0.58] p-4 backdrop-blur-2xl sm:p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-black/10 pb-4">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">模块交付流程</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">从需求到可用模块</p>
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-brand-500/[0.15] bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600">协作中</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3">
            <div class="rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/[0.72] p-4 shadow-sm">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                  <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted">输入</p>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink sm:text-base">需求、资料、表格、工单</p>
                </div>
                <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
              <div class="rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/[0.72] p-4 shadow-sm">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted">AI 处理</p>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink">检索、生成、分类</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/[0.72] p-4 shadow-sm">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted">人工确认</p>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink">边界、规则、审核</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[20px] border border-brand-500/[0.16] bg-brand-50/[0.82] p-4 shadow-sm">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600">输出</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink sm:text-base">功能模块、流程节点、交付说明</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center text-xs font-medium text-muted">
            <span class="rounded-full bg-white/[0.62] px-3 py-2">可集成</span>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-white/[0.62] px-3 py-2">可验收</span>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-white/[0.62] px-3 py-2">可迭代</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
